'''骨まで愛して''' (骨まで愛して, ''Hone made Aishite'', '''?''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after purchasing [[Graveflower Verbena (Uber Rare Cat)|Opulent Verbena]]'s [[Talents|Ultra Talent]]. It was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

